Appendix D
Interview Protocol for Qualitative Analysis
Semi-structured interviews were conducted with selected participants after the intervention.
Interview Questions
How did you experience receiving AI-generated feedback during the writing activities? 
Did the feedback match your English level? Why or why not? 
Which type of feedback helped you improve your writing most? 
Did AI feedback influence your confidence during revision? 
How was ADFF feedback different from general AI feedback? 
