Appendix E
Example of Generic AI Feedback vs. ADFF Feedback
Writing Error:
She go to university every day.
________________________________________
Generic AI Feedback:
Incorrect grammar. The correct sentence is: "She goes to university every day." Remember subject–verb agreement rules.
________________________________________
ADFF Tier 1 (A2):
You wrote go, but with she we add -s to the verb.
Correct:
She goes to university every day.
Example:
He plays football every weekend.
Good work. Keep practicing!
________________________________________
ADFF Tier 3 (C1 Adaptation):
The sentence is grammatically correct after subject–verb agreement adjustment. For more advanced academic contexts, consider whether the expression requires additional contextual information or lexical variation.
